{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 14, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "征", "id": "征"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2669476034873244, "source": "至", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "至", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 3.164067588373206, "source": "上", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 3.56953269648137, "source": "上", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "上", "target": "征"}, {"weight": 3.164067588373206, "source": "下", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "下", "target": "征"}, {"weight": 1.2669476034873244, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "信", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.23732818630616614, "source": "信", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.653241964607215, "source": "義", "target": "勝"}, {"weight": 1.7369512327330598, "source": "義", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "征", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "征", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "征", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 0.5250102587579472, "source": "天下", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.4517496608249867, "source": "天下", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source":